{"type":"message","id":"362e5b75","parentId":"4e2bb88c","timestamp":"2026-04-12T17:25:23.389Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a heartbeat at 1:25 AM on April 13. Let me check the scan schedule - it's past 22:00 but before midnight (UTC 17:25 = 1:25 AM CST). The 22:00 night scan was due about an hour ago. But it's also very early morning (1:25 AM).\n\nLooking at the schedule:\n- 08:00 早盘扫描\n- 12:00 午盘扫描\n- 18:00 晚盘扫描\n- 22:00 夜盘扫描\n\nIt's 1:25 AM CST, which means markets are closed (it's late night). The last scan I did was the evening scan at 17:25 CST. The night scan (22:00) was due about 3.5 hours ago. Let me do the night scan now.\n \nSince it's past 22:00 and the next scan isn't due until 08:00, I'll perform the night scan now with a quick market news check for major developments.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_itr6fyzvgtzy_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":39191,"output":464,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39655,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776014715536}}
{"type":"message","id":"52f6ff82","parentId":"362e5b75","timestamp":"2026-04-12T17:25:23.397Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_itr6fyzvgtzy_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Heartbeat - 每日交易信号扫描\n\n## 🎯 心跳任务\n\n每次心跳时执行以下检查:\n\n### 1. 信息扫描\n- [ ] 扫描市场新闻 (加密货币/美股/宏观)\n- [ ] 检查财报日历 (今日/明日)\n- [ ] 获取恐惧贪婪指数\n\n### 2. 信号生成\n- [ ] 更新技术面指标\n- [ ] 检查预设品种的信号\n- [ ] 记录新信号到 signals/\n\n### 3. 模拟账户\n- [ ] 更新持仓价格\n- [ ] 计算当日 P&L\n- [ ] 检查止损/止盈是否触发\n\n### 4. 报告生成\n- [ ] 生成每日信号报告 (22:00)\n- [ ] 更新 performance.json\n\n---\n\n## 📅 扫描时间\n\n| 时间 | 任务 | 内容 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 08:00 | 早盘扫描 | 隔夜新闻,亚洲市场 |\n| 12:00 | 午盘扫描 | 午间更新,欧洲开盘 |\n| 18:00 | 晚盘扫描 | 美股盘中,财报更新 |\n| 22:00 | 夜盘扫描 | 收盘数据,每日报告 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔔 触发条件\n\n- 正常扫描: 每4小时\n- 重大事件: 新闻关键词触发\n- 止损触发: 模拟持仓触发止损\n\n---\n\n## 📤 输出\n\n- 信号文件: `signals/YYYY-MM-DD.json`\n- 报告文件: `reports/daily/YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n- 持仓更新: `paper-trading/portfolio.json`\n\n---\n\n*心跳配置版本: 1.0*\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776014723396}}
{"type":"message","id":"74b76caf","parentId":"52f6ff82","timestamp":"2026-04-12T17:25:30.475Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It's 1:25 AM on April 13 (CST), which is 22:25 on April 12 UTC. The night scan (22:00) is due. But markets are closed for most instruments at this time.\n\nLet me check if there are any major developments since my last evening scan at 17:25 (9:25 UTC). I need to search for the latest news since it's now 22:25 UTC.\n\nActually, looking at this - it's 1:25 AM Monday CST. Most Asian markets would have closed already. Let me check if there are any Asia market closes to report on.\n\nLet me do a quick news scan and then write the night report.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_gc1a7ag31es8_1","name":"coze_web_search","arguments":{"count":5,"needSummary":true,"query":"美伊谈判 伊斯兰堡 最新结果 2026年4月12日","timeRange":"6h"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_gc1a7ag31es8_2","name":"coze_web_search","arguments":{"count":4,"needSummary":true,"query":"US Iran talks outcome April 12 2026 latest","timeRange":"6h"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":389,"output":427,"cacheRead":39419,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40235,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776014723398}}
